 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ekCRFW_-xB8Q7kNvwFUKtnX&_nc_oc=Ado15SYLX6YBCRgknN9xEcuI_p6aTuxgqBV3UTm9VZXIUSv2AyMuT0Yt04nIV_GC6Nc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGR8fvKql6gt0MOS98W8bk-tbaoOKoYQsDwHHbePc5X0Q&oe=6A786201"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZQafUehFGsQQ7kNvwGkXVE4&_nc_oc=Adrxm8ADIxmAKOTlZGHnguYnhnldaVvyZOIDZlgWLvFFnnaK1LEE-VeOQikyHYtRcNg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHYToZPd8LdcLnou_zyv9IJs-LmeqFnhHxKNe2wjstdGw&oe=6A786F66"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8pElIaBEgfQQ7kNvwHPt3Vg&_nc_oc=AdrtVsZubOxyJAaz2nn0bKVppzqX0i7hThGVMMMINMLGg4HdzeAVxhpWQVri8ERI0g0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEQl_-AGWC_vYoNjkq7_b31e9OLeBoXgcQ9zwii5KUsAg&oe=6A78795C"}, {"fil